{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:51 2026-06-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:51 2026-06-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:51 2026-06-15 HKT</p><p>港姐冠軍黃嘉雯美貌與智慧並重，她熱愛馬術，因而加入馬主行列。現時黃嘉雯和一班好友一起養有團體馬「飛馬座」及「丞匡掠影」。</p><p>黃嘉雯日前在其社交平台分享了她在峇里島渡假的唯美相，相片所見，這位靚女馬主身穿一字膊露肩短身衣服，配上薄紗長裙，美好的身材盡現，充滿夏日風情。</p><p>（相片來源：黃嘉雯IG）</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/63c83a76f3d09be4ea8f690a497fd2f1/2026-06/4cbfb56f-9700-4152-aa9b-24e71e349a5d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/40bb13d7afbf1df5888dc1297f697735/2026-06/62aae873-32cc-445c-aa9c-8de48ee32d80.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/893cf29068a2a4cd940ecaa125e7b14c/2026-06/d60c597b-43f1-48b7-9fa6-48da00d66922.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75fbbc852d7b945bf55b4476fbc271e2/2026-06/db34896c-bc82-412f-a466-182d9ec249aa.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T05:57:52.030654+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}